  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.9.0 adds optional source and exception metadata to LogEntry and documents how to build separate platform-specific logging adapters. Core remains engine-neutral and exposes no generic bridge API. It also includes streamed command output, per-execution progress state, asynchronous command execution, cooperative cancellation, optional host-thread callback dispatch, and synchronized histories. The package continues the ContentSystem-backed rebuild introduced in 0.2.0; ContentSystem remains outside the public API. This pre-1.0 release is not a drop-in upgrade from earlier package versions.",
